            "pretitle": "",
            "title_tag": "h2",
            "title": "Advanced 4-Stage Filtration",
            "subtitle_tag": "h1",
            "subtitle": "",
            "text": "<p>Introducing the Vacmaster 4 stage filtration system. Dust and dirt is first channelled through an advanced HEPA 13 pre-filter before being captured in a fine filtration dust bag. Any remaining microscopic particles are then filtered from the air stream through a pre-motor foam filter and washable HEPA 13 exhaust filter. Trapping 99.9% of dust and allergens inside the vacuum cleaner, whilst also extending the lifetime of the machine.</p>",
            "button_1_style": "link",
            "button_1_text": "",
            "button_1_url": "",
            "button_2_style": "transparent-black",
            "button_2_text": "",
            "button_2_url": ""
          }
        },
