            "image_loading": "",
            "logo": "",
            "pretitle": "",
            "title_tag": "h2",
            "title": "Snag-Free Cable Rewind",
            "subtitle_tag": "h3",
            "subtitle": "",
            "text": "<p>Snag free cable rewind smoothly retracts the 10m power cable for storage. Just pull and your ready to go. And a large foot operated power switch prevents back strain when operating.</p>",
